 status: published
 heroImage: "/assets/posts/the-registry-wave-agentic-artifact-supply-chain/hero-governed-cube.png"
 heroAlt: "A shared capability pattern connects several project workbenches, each retaining a distinct adaptation."
+heroPlacement: frontispiece
 whyItMatters: "Approval attaches to an artifact. Its use happens in a context that approval never saw. A current registry can coexist with stale deployed instructions and unacceptable outcomes."
 leaderTakeaway: "Require four separate assurances: pinned artifact identity, authorized conditions of use, evidence of actual execution, and an accepted outcome. Connect the systems responsible for each."
